Subject: [PATCH] VBA: Word Range and Selection members macros commonly use

Move, Expand, EndOf, StartOf, Next, Previous, Delete, Characters, the
clipboard, Tables, Rows, Columns, Cells, Bookmarks and InlineShapes of a
range, Information in tables, Underline, highlight, statistics, story type;
Selection does the same, and styles can be named as in Word.
